      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Update:\nI decided to test to see if it was my particular windows network stack that was at fault here. so I booted up my Linux partition and ran VRChat with Proton. I know fully well that video players on proton don't work as a result of software limitations. when I tried this. the video players don't show \"Invalid URL\" but instead a combination of errors regarding general video player errors. i don't know if those include Invalid URL or if its a response of video players not functioning through proton.",
