  "details": "This probably started about a week ago. every single video player returns with Invalid URL for me and nothing displays while all other players can see the video. having other players play a video doesn't do anything on my end.\nI thought that this might be an issue on my network stack, so I decided to change my DNS server from my ISP default to both 1.1.1.1 and then 8.8.8.8 and neither changed anything. I even tried playing VRC on my phone hotspot network. so far i'm out of options as i cannot play on a VPN,",
